{"site": {"id": "25-dubai-college", "name": "Dubai College", "type": "School", "country": "UAE", "region": "Middle East", "curriculum": "British", "ownership": "Non-profit", "url": "https://www.dubaicollege.org", "client": false}, "pages": [{"url": "https://www.dubaicollege.org/", "title": "Home - Dubai College", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[16, "a", -48, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [54, "h1", 799, 1, 0, "Home"], [16, "h2", 915, 0, 1, "Welcome"], [18, "p", 1074, 0, 1, "Dubai College is one of the best international schools in the world."], [16, "p", 1139, 0, 0, "At Dubai College we aim to provide a rich holistic education and academic excellence for our students. We exist to equip young people with the deep learning and good character that they will need to flourish in their lives"], [16, "p", 1247, 0, 0, "We welcome you to explore our website and discover our values of excellence, hard work, kindness, and integrity which are engrained in the Dubai College academic, sporting, creative and philanthropic pillars."], [16, "h2", 1650, 0, 1, "Latest News"], [16, "div", 1650, 0, 0, "No post to display."], [16, "h2", 1852, 0, 1, "Dubai College Community"], [34, "h2", 2104, 0, 0, "Student testimonials"], [28, "p", 2180, 0, 0, "Listen to our students sharing what they love about Dubai College."], [12, "p", 2294, 0, 0, "Watch the Video"], [28, "span", 2106, 0, 0, "“One thing I love about Dubai College is our sense of community.”"], [12, "cite", 2245, 0, 0, "Tilly, Deputy Head Girl 2025-2026"], [12, "p", 2282, 0, 0, "WATCH THE VIDEO"], [34, "h2", 2665, 0, 0, "Staff Testimonials"], [28, "p", 2741, 0, 0, "Listen to our staff sharing why they love Dubai College."], [28, "span", 2587, 0, 0, "“The biggest strength of Dubai College is definitely the community and the culture - it is wonderful, even when I first started here, how warm and inviting every single person was\"."], [12, "cite", 2870, 0, 0, "Dr Mohamed - Head of Further Mathematics & KS5 Extension Coordinator"], [34, "h2", 3226, 0, 0, "Parent Testimonials"], [28, "p", 3302, 0, 0, "Listen to our parents sharing what they love about Dubai College."], [28, "span", 3148, 0, 0, "“The reason why we chose Dubai College is because we wanted a school in which our children could excel academically, but also have amazing sporting opportunities.”"], [12, "cite", 3431, 0, 0, "Mrs Zara Akhavan - Parent and Chair of the Friends of Dubai College"], [62, "h2", 3903, 0, 1, "1140"], [22, "h3", 3980, 0, 1, "Students"], [22, "h3", 3980, 0, 1, "Nationalities"], [62, "h2", 3876, 0, 1, "200+"], [22, "h3", 3953, 0, 1, "Character Development Activities"], [62, "h2", 4088, 0, 1, "125"], [22, "h3", 4165, 0, 1, "Teaching Staff"], [62, "h2", 4088, 0, 1, "10:1"], [22, "h3", 4165, 0, 1, "Student:Staff ratio"], [22, "h3", 4165, 0, 1, "Acre site"], [38, "h2", 3856, 0, 1, "Work Hard, Play Hard"], [18, "p", 3920, 0, 1, "Dubai College is so much more than the leading academic school in Dubai, it is a community of excellence at the heart of the city."], [16, "p", 4032, 0, 0, "Our students do have a long track record of excelling academically and this year our GCSE students achieved an impressive 95% at grades 9-7. However, our enviable reputation stems from our consistent and sustained excellence in what we see as the four pillars of the College: sporting, creative, philanthropic as well as academic endeavour."]], "links": [["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about", "About usexpand this section"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about", "Welcome"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/vision-values", "Vision & Values"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/history", "History"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/seniorleadership", "Senior Leadership Team"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/facilities", "Facilities"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/policies", "Policies"], ["https://www.dubaicollege.org/about/inspections", "Inspections an